        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 918-F Decorative Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid forged brass this very ornate decorative  floor mount door stop adds a touch of wow to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or high end commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNot only is it very decorative, the floor mount design provides excellent protection for your walls and door hardware. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/ornate-victorian-floor-door-stop-first-impressions-918r-f\"><b>Ornate Victorian Floor Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\nOnly one hole to drill makes installation fast and easy.  Packaged with mounting hardware  for wood, tile or marble floor mount applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 918-F Decorative Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Diameter:  1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Forged Brass</li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. </b>\r\n</p>",
